- op: discuss  # a9d2
  at: '2026-05-24T00:52:59Z'  # a9d2
  by: agent  # a9d2
  actor: jgstern_agent  # a9d2
  clock: 3  # a9d2
  nonce: a9d2  # a9d2
  message: "Fixed in PR #3882 (5b2d4cfb6c). Vendored tree-sitter-{lean,wolfram,circom} grammars under vendor/tree-sitter-*/ (plain directory copy, MIT-licensed all three). Both build paths (scripts/build-source-grammars and hypergumbo_core.build_grammars) now read vendor/<grammar>/src directly — no git clone at build time. Each grammar ships its upstream LICENSE plus an UPSTREAM file documenting source URL + pinned commit + sync date for re-sync. New TestVendorLayout class pins 5 layout invariants; old git-flow tests removed and replaced with vendor-source-missing + no-git-command-issued regression guards. Re-sync procedure documented in docs/grammars/vendor-sync.md. +12MB to repo (10.7MB of which is tree-sitter-lean/src/parser.c). vendor/ is outside every package's wheel boundary so pip-installed wheel sizes unchanged. Eliminates the 2026-05-20 upstream-force-push failure class entirely."  # a9d2
